<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IPALCO raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IPALCO raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities confirmed it upgraded IPALCO Enterprises Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Prudential said it raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $2.20 a share from $2.05 a share and increased the 1998 earnings estimate to $2.35 a share from $2.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the 12-month price target to $34 a share from $29 a share.</p>
</text>
